Hi.
 
I did a quick look through the archives, but couldn't see anything, or
even a search option.
 
I'm running a 1TB lvm volume with 8 hard drives.
I'm pretty new to lvm and I've never swapped stuff around before, and
was wondering what would happen if I did.
 
I'd like to know if the /dev/ names changing will effect my
volume/group.
Eg. If /dev/hdf and /dev/hdg swapped places, would it care?
 
I know all physical volumes have ids but thought id check just in case.
Thanks for your help.
 
 
Andrew..

